settings.custom_liquid:
{% assign tyt_shop_url = '/collections/ball-mounts' %}
{% assign tyt_guide_url = '/pages/hitch-selection-guide' %}
{% assign tyt_contact_url = '/pages/contact-us' %}

<style>
  .tyt-about {
    --tyt-ink: #181818;
    --tyt-muted: #555555;
    --tyt-line: #dddddd;
    --tyt-surface: #f3f3f3;

    max-width: 1120px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 56px 24px 64px;
    color: var(--tyt-ink);
    font-family: inherit;
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.8;
    overflow-wrap: break-word;
  }

  .tyt-about,
  .tyt-about * {
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  .tyt-about__hero {
    padding-bottom: 40px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--tyt-line);
  }

  .tyt-about__eyebrow {
    margin: 0 0 16px;
    color: var(--tyt-muted);
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .tyt-about h1 {
    margin: 0 0 22px;
    color: var(--tyt-ink);
    font-size: clamp(32px, 4.5vw, 52px);
    line-height: 1.15;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
  }

  .tyt-about h2 {
    margin: 0 0 18px;
    color: var(--tyt-ink);
    font-size: clamp(24px, 3vw, 32px);
    line-height: 1.3;
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
  }

  .tyt-about p {
    margin: 0 0 18px;
  }

  .tyt-about__lead {
    max-width: 760px;
    font-size: 20px;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  .tyt-about__intro {
    max-width: 800px;
    color: var(--tyt-muted);
  }

  .tyt-about__section {
    padding: 36px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--tyt-line);
  }

  .tyt-about__copy {
    max-width: 800px;
  }

  .tyt-about__button {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    min-height: 48px;
    max-width: 100%;
    margin-top: 8px;
    padding: 13px 22px;
    border: 1px solid var(--tyt-ink);
    border-radius: 0;
    background: var(--tyt-ink);
    color: #ffffff;
    font: inherit;
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.4;
    text-align: center;
    text-decoration: none;
    white-space: normal;
  }

  .tyt-about__button:visited {
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .tyt-about__button:hover {
    background: #333333;
    border-color: #333333;
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .tyt-about__button:focus-visible {
    outline: 3px solid #335fb4;
    outline-offset: 4px;
  }

  .tyt-about__button--outline,
  .tyt-about__button--outline:visited {
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--tyt-ink);
  }

  .tyt-about__button--outline:hover {
    background: var(--tyt-ink);
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .tyt-about__contact {
    margin-top: 36px;
    padding: 32px;
    background: var(--tyt-surface);
  }

  .tyt-about__tagline {
    margin: 32px 0 0 !important;
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .tyt-about {
      padding: 32px 20px 40px;
    }

    .tyt-about__hero {
      padding-bottom: 28px;
    }

    .tyt-about__lead {
      font-size: 18px;
    }

    .tyt-about__section {
      padding: 28px 0;
    }

    .tyt-about__contact {
      margin-top: 28px;
      padding: 24px 20px;
    }

    .tyt-about__button {
      width: 100%;
    }
  }
</style>

<article class="tyt-about" lang="en">
  <header class="tyt-about__hero">
    <p class="tyt-about__eyebrow">About TYT Towing</p>

    <h1>The Right Connection for Every Haul</h1>

    <p class="tyt-about__lead">
      A truck loaded for work. A boat ready for the weekend.
      A utility trailer carrying the next project.
    </p>

    <p class="tyt-about__intro">
      Every towing setup starts with a connection between your vehicle
      and what you need to move. At TYT Towing, we focus on equipment
      that helps you make that connection—with product choices suited
      to your trailer, your receiver, and the way you tow.
    </p>
  </header>

  <section class="tyt-about__section">
    <div class="tyt-about__copy">
      <h2>Our Focus</h2>

      <p>
        <strong>Ball mounts are at the center of our range.</strong>
      </p>

      <p>
        Our selection includes adjustable options for 2-inch and
        2.5-inch receivers, with dual-ball and tri-ball configurations
        for different coupler sizes. Adjustable height helps
        accommodate trailers with different coupling heights, while
        multiple ball sizes offer flexibility when you switch trailers.
      </p>

      <p>
        We also offer trailer jacks, hand winches, tie-down straps,
        and other towing and trailer accessories to support the
        tasks around your haul.
      </p>

      <a
        class="tyt-about__button"
        href="{{ tyt_shop_url | escape }}"
      >
        Explore TYT Ball Mounts
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="tyt-about__section">
    <div class="tyt-about__copy">
      <h2>Details That Matter</h2>

      <p>
        Choosing towing equipment involves more than finding a
        product that fits into your receiver.
      </p>

      <p>
        The ball size, loaded trailer weight, tongue weight, and
        required drop or rise all matter. So do the ratings for
        the exact configuration you use.
      </p>

      <p>
        We want those details to be easier to understand. Our Hitch
        Selection Guide walks you through the measurements and
        specifications to check before choosing a ball mount. When
        you need help, you can share your vehicle and trailer
        details with our team.
      </p>

      <a
        class="tyt-about__button tyt-about__button--outline"
        href="{{ tyt_guide_url | escape }}"
      >
        Read the Hitch Selection Guide
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="tyt-about__section">
    <div class="tyt-about__copy">
      <h2>Your Setup Shapes the Conversation</h2>

      <p>
        Customers bring us different trucks, trailers, and
        expectations. Some need one mount for a familiar route.
        Others switch between trailers throughout the week.
      </p>

      <p>
        Those conversations help us understand what matters:
        receiver fit, useful adjustment, the right ball sizes,
        and clear information about capacity.
      </p>

      <p>
        We welcome questions about our current products and requests
        for configurations you would like to see. Your experience
        helps inform where we focus next.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="tyt-about__contact">
    <div class="tyt-about__copy">
      <h2>Talk to TYT</h2>

      <p>
        Tell us what you drive, what you tow, and what you need
        from your setup.
      </p>

      <p>
        For fitment questions, include your receiver size, trailer
        weight, coupler size, and required drop or rise. If you
        already own a TYT product, send its model or order details
        so our team can better understand your question.
      </p>

      <a
        class="tyt-about__button"
        href="{{ tyt_contact_url | escape }}"
      >
        Contact the TYT Team
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <p class="tyt-about__tagline">
    TYT Towing — For the work ahead and the weekends beyond.
  </p>
</article>
